[burgundy anemones @ punggol 01July2011](https://vimeo.com/26266816)
from
[SgBeachBum](https://vimeo.com/sgbeachbum)
on
[Vimeo](https://vimeo.com)
.

---

**Acknowledgements**
Grateful thanks to Prof Daphne Fautin for identifiying this anemone.
