Group 1: Forming leafy fronds or thin plates
*Pavona cactus*
(Vulnerable)
*Pavona explanulata**

Pavona frondifera**

Pavona varians*
Group 2: Do not form leafy shapes
*Pavona decussata***
(Vulnerable)
*Pavona clavus*

