INSERT INTO content_items (collection, path, slug, title, status, body, metadata_json, cover_image, published_at) VALUES ('entries', '_entries/cnidaria/coralhard/faviidae/faviidae.md', 'faviidae', 'Favid hard corals', 'published', '
## Where seen?
Due to a revision of coral groupings, all previous members of Family Faviidae have been placed under different families, most in
[Family Merulinidae](../../merulinidae/merulinidae)
.

---

**Family Faviidae recorded for Singapore**
Danwei Huang, Karenne P. P. Tun, L. M Chou and Peter A. Todd. 30 Dec 2009.
*An inventory of zooxanthellate sclerectinian corals in Singapore including 33 new records*

**the species found on many shores in Danwei''s paper.

Groups based on in Veron, Jen. 2000.
*Corals of the World*
.

in red are those listed as threatened
on the
[IUCN global list](www.iucnredlist.org/)
.

*from
[WORMS](http://www.marinespecies.org/)

**Family Faviidae**

***Leptastrea***
**sp.**
**
(now placed in "Scleractinia incertae sedis (Family)" which means a taxonomic group where its broader relationships are unknown or undefined.)
**
*Leptastrea pruinosa**

Leptastrea purpurea**

Leptastrea transversa***

---
', '{
