---
{% include img-wrap-group.html items=page.galleries.gallery4 %}

**Species are difficult to positively identify without close examination.

On this website, they are grouped by external features for convenience of display.*

---

**Crinkled sandpaper corals on Singapore shores**

On
[wildsingapore flickr](http://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/)

- [Photos](https://www.flickr.com/search/?user_id=54527470@N00&sort=date-posted-desc&view_all=1&text=Crinkled sandpaper coral)
for free download
- [Map of sightings in Singapore](https://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/tags/crinkled%2520sandpaper%2520coral/map?&fLat=1.2959&fLon=103.8743&zl=11&order_by=recent)

---

**Other sightings on Singapore shores**

---
{% include img-wrap-group.html items=page.galleries.gallery5 %}
---
{% include img-wrap-group.html items=page.galleries.gallery6 %}
