(Upside-down jellyfish)

---

**Acknowlegement**

With grateful thanks to
[Dr Michael N Dawson](http://www.ucmerced.edu/faculty/facultybio.asp?facultyid=73)
of the University of California, Merced for identifying this jellyfish.
