- [Photos](https://www.flickr.com/search/?user_id=54527470@N00&sort=date-posted-desc&view_all=1&text=Portunus pelagicus)
for free download
- [Map of sightings in Singapore](https://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/tags/Portunus%2520pelagicus/map?&fLat=1.2622&fLon=103.8661&zl=11&order_by=recent)

