On
[wildsingapore flickr](http://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/)

- [Photos](https://www.flickr.com/search/?user_id=54527470@N00&sort=date-posted-desc&view_all=1&text=Salmacis virgulata)
for free download
- [Map of sightings in Singapore](https://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/tags/Salmacis%2520virgulata/map?&fLat=1.2619&fLon=103.8661&zl=11&order_by=recent)

---

**Other sightings on Singapore shores**

---
