---

**Family Sepiidae recorded for Singapore**
from Tan Siong Kiat and Henrietta P. M. Woo, 2010
*Preliminary Checklist of The Molluscs of Singapore*
.
**
**

**Cuttlefishes awaiting identification**
*Species are difficult to positively identify without close examination.

On this website, they are grouped by external features for convenience of display.*

[Smooth cuttlefish](cutsmooth)

**Family Sepiidae**

*Sepia aculeata

Sepia brevimana

Sepia esculenta

[Sepia latimanus](cutbroadclub)*
(Broadclub cuttlefish)
*Sepia lycidas

Sepia pharaonis

[Sepia recurvirostra](cutcurvespine)*
(Curvespine cuttlefish)
*[Sepiella inermis](cutsmooth)*
(Glittering cuttlefish)

---
