---

**Family Calyptraeidae recorded for Singapore**
from Tan Siong Kiat and Henrietta P. M. Woo, 2010
*Preliminary Checklist of The Molluscs of Singapore*
.
**
^from
[WORMS](http://www.marinespecies.org/)
**

**Family Calyptraeidae**

*^
[Desmaulus extinctorium](calyptraea)
=Calyptraea extinctorium*
(Conical slipper snail)
*^
[Siphopatella walshi](crepidula)
=Crepidula walshi*
(Flat slipper snail)

---
{% include img-wrap-group.html items=page.galleries.gallery4 %}
