**Acknowledgement**
Grateful thanks to
[JK](http://www.blogger.com/profile/13915767910311597056)
for sharing the ID of this snail on the
[wild shores of singapore blog](http://wildshores.blogspot.com/2010/07/dark-side-of-cyrene.html)
.
