---

**Other sightings on Singapore shores**

---
{% include img-wrap-group.html items=page.galleries.gallery4 %}
---

*Thanks to Yan Le Su for identifying this snail.*{% include img-wrap-group.html items=page.galleries.gallery5 %}
---

**Acknowledgements**

With grateful thanks to
[JK](http://www.blogger.com/profile/13915767910311597056)
of
[SiputKuning.com](http://siputkuning.blogspot.com/)
for identifying this snail on the
[wild shores blog](http://wildshores.blogspot.com/2010/12/special-snails-and-sand-diver-on-cyrene.html)
.
[http://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/4010808323/](http://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/4010808323/)
