Lophiotoma acuta

Lophiotoma leucotropis

Lophioturris polytropa

Pseudodaphnella granicostata

Ptychobela suturalis

Thelycytharella vitrea

[Turricula javana](javana)*
(Javan turrid snail)

+
*Turris nadaensis

+Turris undosa*

---
