Filmed on Jul 08 at Cyrene Reefs

[Nudibranch ~ up very close and very personal @ Cyrene Reef, Singapore](https://vimeo.com/1441724)
from
[SgBeachBum](https://vimeo.com/sgbeachbum)
on
[Vimeo](https://vimeo.com)
.

---
