Buttress roots and knee roots.

Lim Chu Kang, Apr 09*
![](https://images.naturehungry.sg/plants/mangrove/bruguiera/gymnorrhiza/090118smkd5887m3.jpg)

Large flowers, each on one stalk.

*Pulau Semakau, Jan 09*

