(Griff.) Ding Hou (Rhizophoraceae) from southeastern Ding Hou (Rhizophoraceae) from southeastern Asia Asia . Blumea (accepted). (SCI) 95-2621-B-415-002-MY2 . Blumea (accepted). (SCI) 95-2621-B-415-002-MY2
