[Pyramid seaweeds](https://www.flickr.com/search/?q=Turbinaria+seaweed&w=54527470%40N00&s=rec)
for free download from
[wildsingapore flickr](http://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/)

---

Distribution in Singapore on
[this wildsingapore flickr map](https://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/tags/Turbinaria%2520seaweed/map?&fLat=1.2619&fLon=103.8661&zl=11&order_by=recent)

---

