[Elegant branching sponges](https://www.flickr.com/search/?q=Haliclona+sp.+Elegant&w=54527470%40N00&s=rec)
for free download from
[wildsingapore flickr](http://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/)

---

Distribution in Singapore on
[this wildsingapore flickr map](https://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/tags/Haliclona%2520sp.%2520Elegant/map?&fLat=1.2626&fLon=103.8661&zl=11&order_by=recent)

---
{% include img-wrap-group.html items=page.galleries.gallery2 %}
---
