**Family Apogonidae recorded for Singapore**
from Heok Hee Ng and Kelvin K. P. Lim. 2014. A preliminary checklist of the cardinalfishes (Actinopterygii: Gobiiformes: Apogonidae) of Singapore.

+Other additions (Singapore Biodiversity Records, etc)

