---

Filmed on Labrador, 2008

[snapping shrimp & goby @ labrador](https://vimeo.com/1211511)
from
[SgBeachBum](https://vimeo.com/sgbeachbum)
on
[Vimeo](https://vimeo.com)
.

---

**Acknowledgement**
With grateful thanks to Zeehan Jaafar for identification of the goby.
