(Fan-bellied filefish)
*Monacanthus choirocephalus=**Paramonacanthus*
*choirocephalus*
(Pig-faced leather jacket)
*Monacanthus cryptodon=**Paramonacanthus cryptodon

Monacanthus macrurus=**
