(Strapweed filefish)
*Monacanthus nemurus=**Paramonacanthus choirocephalus*
(Pig-faced leather jacket)
*Monacanthus sulcatus=**Paramonacanthus sulcatus*
*Monacanthus tomentosus=*
[Acreichthys tomentosus](tomentosus)*
(Seagrass filefish)

