On
[wildsingapore flickr](http://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/)

- [Photos](https://www.flickr.com/search/?user_id=54527470%40N00&sort=date-taken-desc&safe_search=3&view_all=1&text=Scorpaenopsis%20diabolus)
for free download
- [Map of sightings in Singapore](https://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/tags/Scorpaenopsis%2520diabolus/map?&fLat=1.2619&fLon=103.8654&zl=11&order_by=recent)

---

**Other sightings on Singapore shores**

---
