INSERT INTO content_items (collection, path, slug, title, status, body, metadata_json, cover_image, published_at) VALUES ('entries', '_entries/worm/polycladida/orangewhite.md', 'orangewhite', 'Halloween  flatworm', 'published', '
## Where seen?
This black flatworm with orange and white ruffled margins is all ready for Halloween. It is sometimes seen on the reefs of some Southern shores.

## Features

5-8cm long. Body black with broad white and orange margins. Sometimes three narrow white parallel lines in the centre starting from the head, fading towards the end of the body, the two outer lines wider, the central line much narrower. Underside black with orange margins. It has a pair of pseudotentacles that are squarish and ruffled on the sides.
{% include img-wrap-group.html items=page.galleries.gallery1 %}
***
*Species are difficult to positively identify without close examination.

On this website, they are grouped by external features for convenience of display.*

---

**Halloween flatworms on Singapore shores**

On
[wildsingapore flickr](http://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/)

- [Photos](https://www.flickr.com/search/?user_id=54527470@N00&sort=date-posted-desc&view_all=1&text=Halloween flatworm)
for free download
- [Map of sightings in Singapore](https://www.flickr.com/photos/wildsingapore/tags/Halloween%2520flatworm/map?&fLat=1.2626&fLon=103.8654&zl=11&order_by=recent)

---

**Other sightings on Singapore shores**

---
