  - [Farming fishes in cages harms wild fishes](http://wildshores.blogspot.com/2008/12/farming-fish-in-ocean-cages-harms-wildl)
  - [Coastal fish farms: where does the fish waste go?](http://wildshores.blogspot.com/2009/02/coastal-fish-farms-where-does-fishl)
