INSERT INTO content_items (collection, path, slug, title, status, body, metadata_json, cover_image, published_at) VALUES ('articles', '_articles/locations/forest/lowlandforest/bukit-timah-nature-reserve.md', 'bukit-timah-nature-reserve', 'bukit timah nature reserve', 'published', '
The Bukit Timah Nature Reserve is home to a **primary forest**, near the summit of the hill. If you visit Jungle Fall Trail, you will be able to see the primary forest.

## Habitat

Bukit Timah Nature Reserve is home to a Lowland Dipterocarp Forest, with the ridges of the hill being covered in _Shorea curtisii_

This place is great for experiencing Singapore''s once abundant primeval habitat. The island was once covered in Lowland Dipterocarp Forests, Freshwater Swamp Forests, and Mangroves. Other habitat types are considered novel habitats, or are temporary in nature.

Birds found in this place:

- [Asian Fairy Bluebird]()
- [Red-crowned Barbet]()
- [Little Spiderhunter]()
-
