INSERT INTO content_items (collection, path, slug, title, status, body, metadata_json, cover_image, published_at) VALUES ('articles', '_articles/locations/intertidal/southernislands/betingbembanbesar.md', 'betingbembanbesar', 'Beting Bemban Besar', 'published', '
[main index](index.html) to Singapore''s Southern shores for the [southern expedition](http://megamarinesurvey.blogspot.sg/search/label/Southern%20Expedition) | mega marine survey [blog](http://megamarinesurvey.blogspot.sg/)
| [facebook page](https://www.facebook.com/pages/Mega-Marine-Survey-of-Singapore/136892629681549)

# Beting Bemban Besar  

**Habitats:**
Central area sandy, seagrasses on eastern edge, rubbly edges sparsely
reefy, denser corals on western edge facing Terumbu Bemban and on
southern edge facing the Live Firing Area shores.   
1�
12.408''N 103� 44.838''E  
56ha, 1.2km x 600m   
(from [Google
Earth](http://www.google.com/earth/index.html) and [Earth
Point](http://www.earthpoint.us/Shapes.aspx))
![](photos/semakau.jpg)

**Conservation
status:** Does not appear on the [URA
Master Plan 2008](http://www.ura.gov.sg/uramaps/?config=config_preopen.xml&preopen=Master%20Plan) or the [Parks
and Waterbodies Plan](http://www.ura.gov.sg/uramaps/?preopen=Special%20and%20Detailed%20Controls%20Plans%20%28SDCP%29).

**Current conservation activities:**
Since 1986, Western
Semakau is one of the survey sites of [underwater
coral reef surveys](http://coralreef.nus.edu.sg/survey/data.htm) by [ReefFriends](http://www.bluewatervolunteers.org/reeffriends/)
of [NParks](http://www.nparks.gov.sg/cms/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=120&Itemid=123)
and the [Blue Water
Volunteers](http://www.bluewatervolunteers.org/).   
  
The intertidal area of Beting Bemban Besar is also regularly surveyed
by [wildsingapore](https://images.naturehungry.sg/).

**About
the name:** *Beting*=Shoal; *Bemban*=A
type of plant whose stem is used for making baskets, possibly
refering to fish traps; *Besar*=Big.

