  Coastal Environmental Profile of Singapore](http://books.google.com.sg/books?id=qSIJ2uKKs88C&printsec=frontcover#v=onepage&q&f=false)
  by Lin Sien Chia, Habibullah Khan, Loke Ming Chou, The WorldFish
  Center, 1988
- [Coral
  Reefs of Singapore](http://coralreef.nus.edu.sg/island/hantu.htm) by Loh Tse-Lynn and the Reef Ecology Study
  Team, National University of Singapore.
- [Names
  of (some) Singapore islands](http://habitatnews.nus.edu.sg/articles/singaporeislands/) by Jeffrey Low on habitatnews

