---

**Links**

* [Pulau Semakau](https://www.google.com/search?q=../places/semakau.htm) on wildsingapore.
* [TeamSeagrass](http://teamseagrass.blogspot.sg/) Volunteer led effort to monitor seagrass meadows in Singapore including [Semakau](http://teamseagrass.blogspot.sg/search/label/semakau).
* [Project Semakau](http://rmbr.nus.edu.sg/projectsemakau/)
* [Coral Reefs of Singapore](http://coralreef.nus.edu.sg/island/hantu.htm) by Loh Tse-Lynn and the Reef Ecology Study Team, National University of Singapore.
* [Names of (some) Singapore islands](http://habitatnews.nus.edu.sg/articles/singaporeislands/) by Jeffrey Low on habitatnews', '{
