---

**Links**

- [Sentosa](https://images.naturehungry.sg/places/sentosa.htm)
  on wildsingapore.
- [TeamSeagrass](http://teamseagrass.blogspot.sg/)
  Volunteer led effort to monitor seagrass meadows in Singapore
  including [Sentosa](http://teamseagrass.blogspot.sg/search/label/sentosa).
- [Coral
  Reefs of Singapore](http://coralreef.nus.edu.sg/island/hantu.htm) by Loh Tse-Lynn and the Reef Ecology Study
  Team, National University of Singapore.
- [Names
  of (some) Singapore islands](http://habitatnews.nus.edu.sg/articles/singaporeislands/) by Jeffrey Low on habitatnews.
- [Vision of Sentosa Cove](http://www.sentosacove.com/cos/o.x?c=/wbn/pagetree&func=view&rid=1111342) on the Sentosa Cove website.
- [Sentosa Cove](http://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/infopedia/articles/SIP_1547_2009-07-27.html) on the Singapore Infopedia website.

