</td>
<td valign="top" width="20%">
<div align="center"><img height="108" src="../seagrass/spinulosa/030928cjd0024m.jpg" width="108"/><a href="../seagrass/spinulosa.htm"><br/>
              Fern seagrass</a><i><br/>
              Halophila spinulosa</i></div>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<hr/>
how to tell apart
<ul>
<li><a href="chlorophyta/cffeathery.htm">different 
        feathery green seaweeds</a></li>
<li><a href="../../glossary/seagrassweed.htm">feathery 
          seaweeds from seagrasse</a></li>
</ul>
